<title>FRANCE: Aerolineas to up ex-Paris cargo rates March one.</title>
<headline>Aerolineas to up ex-Paris cargo rates March one.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerolineas Argentinas plans to increase its ex-Paris cargo rates by between three and five percent, effective March 1, the Argentine airline's French cargo sales agent, Iberia, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Aerolineas operates a twice-weekly Boeing 747-200F service between Paris and Buenos Aires in conjunction with Air France and a four times weekly 747 passenger service on the same route. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
